; The CiA 408 test device of Cia408PeerTests and Cia408DeviceDescriptionTests: one logical device,
; a pQ valve with 16-bit parameters (control mode 5 only, CiA 408 v2.2.0 Table 82), as Cia408Device
; declares it for that configuration: the eight objects of clause 9.3 (both word pairs, 6043h
; read-only for one control mode), the setpoint and actual value records of control mode 5 (6300h,
; 6301h, 6380h, 6381h; clause 8.7.1, unit and prefix read-only), the CiA 408 error behaviour record
; 1029h (clause 8.6.8) and the default PDOs (mapping 1 in PDO 1, mapping 4 in PDO 2). Cia408PeerTests
; checks every object in 6000h-67FFh against the catalogue and against the device's dictionary,
; with each entry's type, access and default value, and 1000h, 1029h and the PDO records against the
; device, so the file cannot drift from either. The status words' defaults are INIT, as the device shows it.

